## 🌐 Web Application

The project includes an interactive Flask web application.

### 🏠 Home Page

Provides an overview of the project and its purpose.

### 🔮 Prediction Page

Users can select:

* Season
* City
* Team 1
* Team 2
* Toss Winner
* Toss Decision

The application then predicts the expected winning team using the trained Machine Learning model.

